# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Atomic-write temp files from store.py
*.jsonl.tmp
*.json.tmp

# data/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the committed JSONL is both the database and
# the audit trail that makes the scoreboard impossible to rewrite after the fact.
#
# .scratch/ (the wayfinder map and its tickets) is excluded globally via
# ~/.config/git/ignore, so it stays local working notes rather than travelling with
# the repo. Add a negation here if this project ever wants to share them.
